Q.How can we create statefiles in s3 bucket

1.bucket-name: mycompany-terraform-state

2.Create a file named backend.tf:

terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket         = "mycompany-terraform-state"   # Your S3 bucket
    key            = "prod/network/terraform.tfstate"  # Path inside bucket
    region         = "ap-south-1"
    dynamodb_table = "terraform-locks"             # For locking
    encrypt        = true                           # Encrypt state at rest (SSE-S3/KMS)
  }
}

Folder structure:
------------------
environments/
  dev/
    backend.tf
  stage/
    backend.tf
  prod/
    backend.tf


